p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">교육 혜택</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">멘토링 진행</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">게임 분야</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">블록체인 전문가 특강</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">온라인 기초 강좌 지원</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">스프린트 방식 경험</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">5.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">스터디 운영</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">6.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교육생 밀착 케어</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">7.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">월&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">회 이상 네트워킹</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">8.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">클라우드 기반 실습 환경</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p>